msgid "Transformation on unloaded image."
msgstr "আনল'ড কৰা ছবিত ৰূপান্তৰণ।"

#: src/eog-image.c:598
#, c-format
msgid "Transformation failed."
msgstr "ৰূপান্তৰণ ব্যৰ্থ হল।"

#: src/eog-image.c:1139
